WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:03.080
(bright music)

2
00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.890
Here's a little weekday motivation

3
00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:07.320
from someone who inspires us.

4
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.860 line:15%
Hi Drew, this is Rachel Montez Minor.

5
00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.360 line:15%
I'm an actress, dancer, and singer.

6
00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.297 line:15%
And now I'm the author of the children's book,

7
00:00:14.297 --> 00:00:15.950
"The Sun, The Moon, and The Stars."

8
00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.150
And I can't wait to share it with all of you.

9
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.890
I had a deep meditation practice

10
00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:23.460
and when I became pregnant with my daughter,

11
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:27.700
I had a dream and I saw the cover of this book

12
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:28.910
with the title in the middle

13
00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:31.800
and children sitting around it in a circle.

14
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.350
And then all of the words of the book

15
00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:36.050
just were downloaded to me.

16
00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:36.920
It's unconventional.

17
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.540
And 12 books came that way during my pregnancy.

18
00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.840
I do believe because I spend so much time in nature

19
00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.780
and meditate a lot that, you know,

20
00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:47.840
that's how the book kind of chose me.

21
00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:51.020
I think if we create space in our life

22
00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.670
through taking a deep breath, getting out in nature,

23
00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:58.500
taking a walk, deciding to look up at the sun and the trees

24
00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.670
and the clouds,

25
00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.220
and take a break from looking down at your phone,

26
00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:05.750
allowing some time that is uncontrolled,

27
00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.740
even if it's just a daydream,

28
00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:09.920
that's when we can get our inspiration.

29
00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:12.110
It can let magic in our lives.

30
00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:14.512 line:15%
Thank you for sharing that with us.

31
00:01:14.512 --> 00:01:17.095 line:15%
(bright music)

